                                        "sense_id": "cbe2b08e-bc5b-3315-b1f6-d7bd07cf4c17",
                                        "entry_id": "7960c38d-ecf9-37cb-8206-c0d886030c87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Flared riding trousers of heavy cloth, fitting tightly from knee to ankle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8caf7155-f093-42cd-9f69-4a5d8174f7fc",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe2b08e-bc5b-3315-b1f6-d7bd07cf4c17",
                                                "text": "\"What's the big idea?\" Dorothy sprang in beside him, looking very trim and boyish in jodhpurs and dark flannel shirt over which she wore a thin brown sweater."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c2188ac-2e5d-4d5c-a7c1-ffe94da7bcdd",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe2b08e-bc5b-3315-b1f6-d7bd07cf4c17",
                                                "text": "The man in jodphurs muttered, ‘Is why black people can't get on. You see how these waiters behaving? And they black like hell too, you know.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3dc514c-db17-4a73-9789-e1405fba0301",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe2b08e-bc5b-3315-b1f6-d7bd07cf4c17",
                                                "text": "All the portraits that hang on the walls of the living room are, I realize, of my mother's family: miniatures of her great-aunts in Victorian bustles and elaborate feathered hats; a gilt-framed oil of her great-great-great-uncle as a boy in pastoral England, wearing a gold riding coat over white jodhpurs and sitting astride a white steed, a King Charles spaniel yapping at them from the foreground of the canvas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bca1409e-a3a5-43a1-b199-060a68139892",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe2b08e-bc5b-3315-b1f6-d7bd07cf4c17",
                                                "text": "Soon Bowie entered, wearing three-tone NASA jodhpurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
